{"id":"passant","lemma":"passant","pos":"adj","rank":2322,"glosses":["busy (as in a busy street)","passant"],"ipa":"/pa.sɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3e/Fr-passant.ogg/Fr-passant.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"passante","masculinePlural":"passants","femininePlural":"passantes"},"formAudio":{"passante":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-passante.wav","passants":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/83/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-passants.wav","passantes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-passantes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Un passant a filmé la scène.","en":"A bystander captured it on video.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to film","l":"filmer"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"stage"}]},{"text":"J'ai peur rien qu'en passant près de lui.","en":"I get scared just walking past him.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,null,null,{"g":"him, he, it"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"close to, near."]]},{"text":"Soyez vigilant lorsque vous traversez une rue très passante !","en":"Be alert when you cross a busy street!","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"vigilant"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to cross, to go across","l":"traverser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"street, road"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Il me fit signe de la tête en passant.","en":"He nodded to me as he passed.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"sign (indicator"},null,null,{"g":"head"},{"g":"in / of it"},null],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]},{"text":"Les années passant, elle devenait de plus en plus belle.","en":"She became more and more beautiful as she grew older.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"year","l":"année"},null,{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to become","l":"devenir"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"handsome","l":"beau"}],"phrases":[[5,9,"more and more"]]}]}